<div id="__nuxt"><div><main id="main-content" class="default-layout__main"><!--[--><div data-page="[subpath1]/[uid].vue"><div class="outer-container"><div><!--[--><section id="the-best-courier-service-for-small-&amp;-medium-parcels" class="page-header page-header--standard" index="0" data-v-93adf07f><div class="page-header__container" data-v-93adf07f><div class="page-header__content" data-v-93adf07f><div class="page-header__text-content" data-v-93adf07f><!----><h1 class="page-header__title" data-v-93adf07f>The best courier service for small &amp; medium parcels</h1><!--v-if--></div><div class="page-header__buttons" data-v-93adf07f><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-primary e-button--variant-3 e-button--icon-right e-button--link page-header__button" data-gtm-track="a-Send a parcel today-open https://www.evri.com/send page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/send" data-v-93adf07f style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Send a parcel today<!--]--></span></a><!----></div></div><div class="page-header__media" data-v-93adf07f><div class="page-header__media-text-image" data-v-93adf07f><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/be2c756c-941a-4d5c-9ee4-e588846e0298_send-landing.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max" srcset="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/be2c756c-941a-4d5c-9ee4-e588846e0298_send-landing.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/be2c756c-941a-4d5c-9ee4-e588846e0298_send-landing.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/be2c756c-941a-4d5c-9ee4-e588846e0298_send-landing.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Send a parcel" width="500" height="132" class="page-header__text-image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-93adf07f></div></div></div><!----></section><section id="discover-why-our-customers-love-evri" class="section-wrapper" index="1" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6thLpbqstJ9-e91_EVRI_LOCATION_05_62178a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6thLpbqstJ9-e91_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6217.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6thLpbqstJ9-e91_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6217.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6thLpbqstJ9-e91_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6217.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An Evri Courier handing over two parcels to an ecastatic mother and child at their doorstep." width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Discover why our customers love Evri</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->As the largest dedicated parcel delivery company in the UK, quality and efficiency are a priority for our customers. And because of the efficiency that our parcels travel through our network, we are able to offer some of the best prices on the market.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->With handy parcel tracking and options to divert included as standard, we’ve made convenience and flexibility more accessible than ever. You can be sure that your package arrives safely, on time and in the way that you want it to.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->As delivery partners for top retail brands, online shoppers across the country are greeted regularly with an Evri courier providing our standard excellent experience. That’s why our services are trusted by clients like Hello Fresh, John Lewis, Wayfair, Ann Summers, Marks and Spencer, Pets at Home, Shein and more.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="see-how-evri-compares-to-other-couriers" class="section-wrapper feature-link-cards" index="2" data-v-5ebb0713 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><h2 data-v-5ebb0713>See how Evri compares to other couriers</h2><p class="feature-link-cards__text" data-v-5ebb0713>We also exceed in price, convenience, satisfaction, and other key areas compared to many other big-name couriers in the UK. Check out our comprehensive comparisons for more information.</p><div class="feature-link-cards__cards" data-v-5ebb0713><!--[--><a href="/guides/evri-vs-royal-mail" class="e-link-card e-link-card--small-on-desktop e-link-card--href feature-link-cards__card" data-test-id="e-link-card" data-v-5ebb0713 data-v-92810816><div class="e-link-card__left" data-v-92810816><!----><div data-v-92810816><div class="e-link-card__title" data-test-id="e-link-card-title" data-v-92810816>Evri vs Royal Mail <!----></div><div class="e-link-card__description" data-test-id="e-link-card-description" data-v-92810816><!--[-->See how we compare<!--]--></div></div></div><div class="e-icon e-link-card__right-icon" aria-hid