-test-id="chevron_circle_right" data-v-92810816 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron right</title> <g> <path d="M12.68 12L10.3 14.38C10.12 14.56 10.03 14.79 10.03 15.06C10.03 15.34 10.12 15.57 10.3 15.78C10.5 15.97 10.74 16.07 11.01 16.07C11.29 16.07 11.53 15.97 11.72 15.78L14.8 12.7C15 12.5 15.1 12.27 15.1 12C15.1 11.73 15 11.5 14.8 11.3L11.7 8.2C11.5 8 11.27 7.9 11 7.91C10.73 7.92 10.5 8.03 10.3 8.22C10.12 8.43 10.02 8.66 10.01 8.93C10 9.19 10.1 9.43 10.3 9.62L12.68 12ZM12 22C10.62 22 9.32 21.74 8.1 21.21C6.88 20.69 5.83 19.98 4.92 19.07C4.03 18.18 3.31 17.12 2.79 15.9C2.26 14.68 2 13.38 2 12C2 10.62 2.26 9.32 2.79 8.1C3.31 6.88 4.03 5.83 4.92 4.92C5.83 4.03 6.88 3.31 8.1 2.79C9.32 2.26 10.62 2 12 2C13.38 2 14.68 2.26 15.9 2.79C17.12 3.31 18.18 4.03 19.07 4.92C19.98 5.83 20.69 6.88 21.21 8.1C21.74 9.32 22 10.62 22 12C22 13.38 21.74 14.68 21.21 15.9C20.69 17.12 19.98 18.18 19.07 19.07C18.18 19.98 17.12 20.69 15.9 21.21C14.68 21.74 13.38 22 12 22ZM12 20C14.23 20 16.12 19.23 17.68 17.68C19.23 16.12 20 14.23 20 12C20 9.77 19.23 7.88 17.68 6.33C16.12 4.78 14.23 4 12 4C9.77 4 7.88 4.78 6.33 6.33C4.78 7.88 4 9.77 4 12C4 14.23 4.78 16.12 6.33 17.68C7.88 19.23 9.77 20 12 20Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></a><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="an-evri-courier-walking-down-the-street-in-a-residential-area-carrying-two-parcels" class="photo-container" index="3" data-v-b709af2f><picture data-v-b709af2f><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6tg4pbqstJ9-e9A_EVRI_LOCATION_05_617185e5.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6tg4pbqstJ9-e9A_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6171.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C2983%2C8192%2C1911&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6tg4pbqstJ9-e9A_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6171.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C2983%2C8192%2C1911&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6tg4pbqstJ9-e9A_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6171.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C2983%2C8192%2C1911&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An Evri Courier walking down the street in a residential area carrying two parcels" width="1200" height="280" class="photo-block" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-b709af2f></picture></section><section id="section-wrapper" class="section-wrapper wrapper" index="4" data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><div data-v-85d73ac7><div data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-5d43a0fc><div id="what-makes-evri-the-best-uk-courier-services-for-small-and-medium-parcels?" class="list-block__text-container" data-v-5d43a0fc><h2 class="list-block__title" data-v-5d43a0fc>What makes Evri the best UK courier services for small and medium parcels?</h2><p class="list-block__desc" data-v-5d43a0fc>Our size and weight limits aren’t a restriction of our service; they’re a commitment to the cheap, fast and safe delivery of small and medium parcels across the country and internationally. We offer complete flexibility, an outstanding service you can rely on, and for great value. Each time you send parcels with us, you and your customers can enjoy these benefits plus the following:</p></div><!--[--><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/b74714dd-731c-4f7a-8fcc-880b9933ca1b_on_time.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="On time icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Fast delivery options</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->The majority of our UK parcels will reach their destination in just 2 – 3 days with our Standard shipping option. We also offer <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/next-day-parcel-delivery" class=""><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Next Day delivery<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> from as little as 60p extra.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/8b145688-a43b-4d6e-b22c-b7b556cc29a2_track.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Track location icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>End-to-end tracking</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->For no extra cost, we provide regular updates on your parcel’s location and a delivery window of just 1 hour. So, no more clearing a day in your calendar to wait for your parcel; you’ll know exactly when we’ll be there.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/d7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Phone icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Parcel divert options</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our delivery window isn’t set in stone either! If you or your customer finds that you’re going to be out during the allotted delivery time, then you can easily divert your parcel to a chosen neighbour, a safe place, or one of our 10,000+ ParcelShops or Lockers.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/0d6596ea-88df-43fd-b67a-22e944657aa2_pricing.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Pricing icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Parcel cover</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We include <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/guides/parcel-cover" rel="noreferrer" target="_self"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->FREE cover<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> up to £20*. You can also increase the value of cover up to £999. *Excludes Postable parcels.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/0b4ebd07-2b68-4949-b6d0-18745f26e60b_lorry.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Lorry icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>International parcel delivery</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our international courier services cover 200+ countries and territories, and we’re constantly expanding. Our great prices don’t stop there either with overseas shipping from as little as £6.08.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/e46b1c07-9c5d-4878-bb23-783ae73ba32f_user.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="User icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Customer services</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We’re here to help answer any customer queries quickly and easily with our new telephone and chatbot support services.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/8d947c5f-d007-4da4-b0c6-86691eda4240_success.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Success icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Proof of delivery</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Your recipient will receive photo confirmation when their parcel is delivered to a <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->‘<!--]--><!--]--><a href="/guides/safe-place" rel="noreferrer" target="_self"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Safe Place<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->’<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->. Or for a minor additional fee you can get a <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/signature" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->signed for delivery<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, so can know without a shadow of a doubt that your parcel exchanged hands.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="save-up-to-26%-with-our-new-small-parcel-service" class="section-wrapper" index="5" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJL5bqstJ9-Tf1_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2863a942.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJL5bqstJ9-Tf1_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2863.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJL5bqstJ9-Tf1_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2863.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJL5bqstJ9-Tf1_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2863.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Customer walking towards a ParcelShop store holding a parcel. The blue Evri signage can be seen on the storefront with a free-standing sign near the entrance." width="7723" height="5151" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Save up to 26% with our new small parcel service</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If you need to send a smaller parcel, you could save up to 26% or £1.27 for every small parcel you send.  Our <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->NEW<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> small parcel service is available for parcels up to 2kg and measuring up to 45cm x 35cm x 16cm. You will still get benefits such as up to £20 cover end-to-end tracking and more included. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--icon e-button--link card__button" data-gtm-track="button-Send a small parcel" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/small-parcel" data-v-e1e30b9c style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><div class="e-button__icon" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_right" data-test-id="chevron_right" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron right</title> <g> <path d="M12.6 12L8.7 8.1C8.52 7.92 8.42 7.68 8.42 7.4C8.42 7.12 8.52 6.88 8.7 6.7C8.88 6.52 9.12 6.42 9.4 6.42C9.68 6.42 9.92 6.52 10.1 6.7L14.7 11.3C14.8 11.4 14.87 11.51 14.91 11.62C14.95 11.74 14.97 11.87 14.97 12C14.97 12.13 14.95 12.26 14.91 12.38C14.87 12.49 14.8 12.6 14.7 12.7L10.1 17.3C9.92 17.48 9.68 17.57 9.4 17.57C9.12 17.57 8.88 17.48 8.7 17.3C8.52 17.12 8.42 16.88 8.42 16.6C8.42 16.32 8.52 16.08 8.7 15.9L12.6 12Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div><!--]--></div><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--> Send a small parcel<!--]--></span></a><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0