.846l2.033-16.198c.258-1.96.407-3.932.445-5.908 0-9.464-4.637-13.72-15.245-13.72h-3.367l-1.905 14.419c4.001 0 5.462.762 5.462 3.875.058.76.058 1.525 0 2.286L144.32 40.12ZM257.261 60.638v.38a1.083 1.083 0 0 0 .762 1.144h36.589a1.08 1.08 0 0 0 1.143-1.143v-.381a1.088 1.088 0 0 0-.314-.83 1.08 1.08 0 0 0-.829-.314h-5.59c-5.082 0-6.352-2.668-6.352-6.797V4.231h2.286c9.592 0 15.944 3.557 15.944 17.405v5.272a1.07 1.07 0 0 0 .069.448 1.076 1.076 0 0 0 1.075.695h.381a1.08 1.08 0 0 0 1.143-1.143V2.325a1.071 1.071 0 0 0-.314-.829 1.08 1.08 0 0 0-.829-.314h-52.342a1.08 1.08 0 0 0-1.143 1.143v24.583a1.086 1.086 0 0 0 .314.83 1.08 1.08 0 0 0 .829.313h.381a1.02 1.02 0 0 0 1.1-.682c.05-.148.065-.306.044-.461v-5.272c0-13.848 6.225-17.405 15.944-17.405h2.413v48.466c0 4.13-1.27 6.797-6.352 6.797h-5.208a1.083 1.083 0 0 0-1.076.695 1.088 1.088 0 0 0-.068.449ZM313.668 1.055h46.307v13.212h-31.761V25.32h31.761v12.704h-31.761v10.99h31.761v13.212h-46.307V1.055Z" fill="#fff" data-v-03e10e28></path><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="m375.029 44.758-8.194 7.622v9.655h33.856L416 46.79V16.3L400.691 1.055h-33.856v9.973l8.194 7.622v26.108Zm33.222-6.352-6.353 6.352-19.056.063V18.714h19.056l6.353 6.352v13.34Z" fill="#fff" data-v-03e10e28></path></svg><h2 data-v-03e10e28>The best courier service is a trusted one</h2><p class="text__desc" data-v-03e10e28>More than 99% of our parcels are delivered on time, and it hasn’t gone unnoticed. We&#39;re ending 2025 with over 4 million 5-star reviews on Trustpilot and a GREAT score of 4.1 out of 5. 

When it comes to satisfaction, there should be no expense spared. With Evri’s low-cost shipping, you can cut your delivery expenses and receive amazing feedback. As well as delivering for some of the UK’s largest retailers, our services can be made flexible at all stages of delivery, from drop off to delivery. 

Trust Evri to deliver your parcel, whether it’s to a friend, loved one or valued customer, check out what they could be saying:</p></div><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6tjlJbqstJ9-fAS_EVRI_LOCATION_05_72018a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6tjlJbqstJ9-fAS_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7201.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6tjlJbqstJ9-fAS_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7201.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6tjlJbqstJ9-fAS_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7201.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A family of four pose smiling in front of their front door holding two parcels. The family consists of a father, mother and two daughters." width="1000" height="667" class="trustpilot__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-03e10e28><a href="#skip-reviews" class="trustpilot__skip" data-v-03e10e28>skip reviews</a><div class="trustpilot__widget trustpilot-widget trustpilot-slice" data-locale="en-GB" data-template-id="53aa8912dec7e10d38f59f36" data-businessunit-id="620fbe077a2b86af5e54e1a2" data-style-height="140px" data-style-width="100%" data-theme="light" data-stars="4,5" data-review-languages="en" data-font-family="Poppins" data-v-03e10e28><a href="https://uk.trustpilot.com/review/www.evri.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-03e10e28> Trustpilot </a></div></div><span id="skip-reviews" data-v-03e10e28></span></section><section id="our-incredible-parcelshops" class="section-wrapper" index="7" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/ad941cc1-66cb-47db-912a-0d4b785cd153_DSCF41729378.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/ad941cc1-66cb-47db-912a-0d4b785cd153_DSCF4172.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C269%2C6924%2C4653&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/ad941cc1-66cb-47db-912a-0d4b785cd153_DSCF4172.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C269%2C6924%2C4653&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/ad941cc1-66cb-47db-912a-0d4b785cd153_DSCF4172.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C269%2C6924%2C4653&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Woman handing parcel to cashier at Post Office" width="1000" height="672" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Our incredible ParcelShops</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We’re constantly engaging with local communities to enhance access to our facilities for sending and receiving parcels. That’s why we’ve opened 9,000+ ParcelShops into local businesses across the UK, including selected <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/post-office-services" rel="noreferrer" target="_self"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Post Offices<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->With 94% of the UK population living within 2 miles of a ParcelShop or Locker, we’ve made sure our locations are convenient to suit any schedule, with most including:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><ul><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Longer opening hours<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Open 7 days a week<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->FREE parking nearby<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ul><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->You can simply select the Evri ParcelShop option when you make a booking or <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/guides/divert-your-parcel" rel="noreferrer" target="_self"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->divert your parcel<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> and find the ParcelShop that&#39;s most convenient. Once delivered, your customer can collect their parcel at any time within opening hours.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--icon e-button--link card__button" data-gtm-track="button-Find out more" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/parcelshops" data-v-e1e30b9c style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><div class="e-button__icon" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_right" data-test-id="chevron_right" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron right</title> <g> <path d="M12.6 12L8.7 8.1C8.52 7.92 8.42 7.68 8.42 7.4C8.42 7.12 8.52 6.88 8.7 6.7C8.88 6.52 9.12 6.42 9.4 6.42C9.68 6.42 9.92 6.52 10.1 6.7L14.7 11.3C14.8 11.4 14.87 11.51 14.91 11.62C14.95 11.74 14.97 11.87 14.97 12C14.97 12.13 14.95 12.26 14.91 12.38C14.87 12.49 14.8 12.6 14.7 12.7L10.1 17.3C9.92 17.48 9.68 17.57 9.4 17.57C9.12 17.57 8.88 17.48 8.7 17.3C8.52 17.12 8.42 16.88 8.42 16.6C8.42 16.32 8.52 16.08 8.7 15.9L12.6 12Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div><!--]--></div><span data-test-id="e-button-