"showPremiumLogo":20},"standard","The best courier service for small & medium parcels",[],"Send a parcel today",{"link_type":33,"key":34,"url":35},"Web","8264035a-cbb5-4fdf-bedf-736af141d812","best-courier-services-in-the-uk.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend",null,{"link_type":38},"Any",{"dimensions":40,"alt":43,"copyright":36,"url":44,"id":45,"edit":46},{"width":41,"height":42},500,132,"Send a parcel","best-courier-services-in-the-uk.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fbe2c756c-941a-4d5c-9ee4-e588846e0298_send-landing.svg","YiExBxIAACgAAWmC",{"x":47,"y":47,"zoom":48,"background":49},0,1,"transparent",{},{"link_type":18},"page_header$4f228367-dd5a-4cba-98d3-443e5102f8b0","page_header",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":55,"primary":56,"id":80,"slice_type":81,"slice_label":36},[],{"CardImage":57,"CardAvatar":65,"CardTitle":66,"CardText":67,"ButtonText":36,"ButtonUrl":79,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":58,"alt":61,"copyright":36,"url":62,"id":63,"edit":64},{"width":59,"height":60},1000,667,"An Evri Courier handing over two parcels to an ecastatic mother and child at their doorstep.","best-courier-services-in-the-uk.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6thLpbqstJ9-e91_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6217.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6thLpbqstJ9-e91",{"x":47,"y":47,"zoom":48,"background":49},"none","Discover why our customers love Evri",[68,73,76],{"type":69,"text":70,"spans":71,"direction":72},"paragraph","As the largest dedicated parcel delivery company in the UK, quality and efficiency are a priority for our customers. And because of the efficiency that our parcels travel through our network, we are able to offer some of the best prices on the market.",[],"ltr",{"type":69,"text":74,"spans":75,"direction":72},"With handy parcel tracking and options to divert included as standard, we’ve made convenience and flexibility more accessible than ever. You can be sure that your package arrives safely, on time and in the way that you want it to.",[],{"type":69,"text":77,"spans":78,"direction":72},"As delivery partners for top retail brands, online shoppers across the country are greeted regularly with an Evri courier providing our standard excellent experience. That’s why our services are trusted by clients like Hello Fresh, John Lewis, Wayfair, Ann Summers, Marks and Spencer, Pets at Home, Shein and more.",[],{"link_type":38},"card$0808c5b4-826b-4fc4-8067-8c64a282c7b4","card",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":83,"primary":108,"id":111,"slice_type":112,"slice_label":36},[84,97],{"title":85,"content":86,"pillEnabled":20,"link":87,"dataGtmTrack":36},"Evri vs Royal Mail","See how we compare",{"id":88,"type":89,"tags":90,"lang":15,"slug":91,"first_publication_date":92,"last_publication_date":93,"uid":94,"url":95,"link_type":18,"key":96,"isBroken":20},"ZZfN9hEAACIAPwKz","content-page",[],"evri-vs-royal-mail-price-comparison","2024-01-05T10:31:57+0000","2026-07-09T08:17:05+0000","evri-vs-royal-mail","\u002Fguides\u002Fevri-vs-royal-mail","ae562d0b-4d6b-4db7-a901-8b75f16cb6f6",{"title":98,"content":86,"pillEnabled":20,"link":99,"dataGtmTrack":36},"Evri vs Yodel",{"id":100,"type":89,"tags":101,"lang":15,"slug":102,"first_publication_date":103,"last_publication_date":104,"uid":105,"url":106,"link_type":18,"key":107,"isBroken":20},"Zae_TxEAAJCKfbzi",[],"yodel-vs-evri-which-parcel-delivery-service-is-better","2024-01-17T12:27:02+0000","2026-03-10T10:05:16+0000","evri-vs-yodel","\u002Fguides\u002Fevri-vs-yodel","4d0d6228-383b-451b-9941-c05ccc237119",{"sectionTitle":109,"sectionDescription":110,"pillEnabled":20,"showPaddingTop":20},"See how Evri compares to other couriers","We also exceed in price, convenience, satisfaction, and other key areas compared to many other big-name couriers in the UK. Check out our comprehensive comparisons for more information.","feature_link_cards$a4f56754-8ddd-44da-aa12-c5c0d2af7f6a","feature_link_cards",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":114,"primary":115,"id":139,"sli