sA0bhj",[156],"Our Services","next-day-parcel-delivery--next-day-courier-services--evri","2022-02-23T16:42:34+0000","2026-07-09T07:02:15+0000","next-day-parcel-delivery","\u002Four-services\u002Fnext-day-parcel-delivery",{"start":150,"end":151,"type":163},"strong",{"dimensions":165,"alt":167,"copyright":36,"url":168,"id":169,"edit":170},{"width":166,"height":166},40,"On time icon","best-courier-services-in-the-uk.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fb74714dd-731c-4f7a-8fcc-880b9933ca1b_on_time.svg","YflBvREAACIA8pXI",{"x":47,"y":47,"zoom":48,"background":49},{},{"title":173,"content":174,"isNumbered":20,"icon":178,"image":184},"End-to-end tracking",[175],{"type":69,"text":176,"spans":177,"direction":72},"For no extra cost, we provide regular updates on your parcel’s location and a delivery window of just 1 hour. So, no more clearing a day in your calendar to wait for your parcel; you’ll know exactly when we’ll be there.",[],{"dimensions":179,"alt":180,"copyright":36,"url":181,"id":182,"edit":183},{"width":166,"height":166},"Track location icon","best-courier-services-in-the-uk.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8b145688-a43b-4d6e-b22c-b7b556cc29a2_track.svg","Yh96FRIAACgA-Zrj",{"x":47,"y":47,"zoom":48,"background":49},{},{"title":186,"content":187,"isNumbered":20,"icon":191,"image":197},"Parcel divert options",[188],{"type":69,"text":189,"spans":190,"direction":72},"Our delivery window isn’t set in stone either! If you or your customer finds that you’re going to be out during the allotted delivery time, then you can easily divert your parcel to a chosen neighbour, a safe place, or one of our 10,000+ ParcelShops or Lockers.",[],{"dimensions":192,"alt":193,"copyright":36,"url":194,"id":195,"edit":196},{"width":166,"height":166},"Phone icon","best-courier-services-in-the-uk.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg","Yh96FxIAACwA-Zse",{"x":47,"y":47,"zoom":48,"background":49},{},{"title":199,"content":200,"isNumbered":20,"icon":211,"image":217},"Parcel cover",[201],{"type":69,"text":202,"spans":203,"direction":72},"We include FREE cover up to £20*. You can also increase the value of cover up to £999. *Excludes Postable parcels.",[204,210],{"start":205,"end":206,"type":152,"data":207},11,21,{"link_type":33,"url":208,"target":209},"best-courier-services-in-the-uk.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fguides\u002Fparcel-cover","_self",{"start":205,"end":206,"type":163},{"dimensions":212,"alt":213,"copyright":36,"url":214,"id":215,"edit":216},{"width":166,"height":166},"Pricing icon","best-courier-services-in-the-uk.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F0d6596ea-88df-43fd-b67a-22e944657aa2_pricing.svg","Yh96FhIAACkA-Zrx",{"x":47,"y":47,"zoom":48,"background":49},{},{"title":219,"content":220,"isNumbered":20,"icon":224,"image":230},"International parcel delivery",[221],{"type":69,"text":222,"spans":223,"direction":72},"Our international courier services cover 200+ countries and territories, and we’re constantly expanding. Our great prices don’t stop there either with overseas shipping from as little as £6.08.",[],{"dimensions":225,"alt":226,"copyright":36,"url":227,"id":228,"edit":229},{"width":166,"height":166},"Lorry icon","best-courier-services-in-the-uk.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F0b4ebd07-2b68-4949-b6d0-18745f26e60b_lorry.svg","Yh96FxIAACoA-ZsY",{"x":47,"y":47,"zoom":48,"background":49},{},{"title":232,"content":233,"isNumbered":20,"icon":237,"image":243},"Customer services",[234],{"type":69,"text":235,"spans":236,"direction":72},"We’re here to help answer any customer queries quickly and easily with our new telephone and chatbot support services.",[],{"dimensions":238,"alt":239,"copyright":36,"url":240,"id":241,"edit":242},{"width":166,"height":166},"User icon","best-courier-services-in-the-uk.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fe46b1c07-9c5d-4878-bb23-783ae73ba32f_user.svg","Yh96FxIAACwA-Zsi",{"x":47,"y":47,"zoom":48,"background":49},{},{"title":245,"content":246,"isNumbered":20,"icon":264,"image":270},"Proof of delivery",[247],{"type":69,"text":248,"spans":249,"direction":72},"Your recipient will receive photo confirmation when their parcel is delivered to a ‘Safe Place’. Or for a minor additional fee you can get a signed for delivery, so can know without a shadow of a doubt that your parcel exchanged hands.",[250,253,258,263],{"start":251,"end":252,"type":163},83,95,{"start":254,"end":255,"type":152,"data":256},84,94,{"link_type":33,"url":257,"target":209},"best-courier-services-in-the-uk.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fguides\u002Fsafe-place",{"start":259,"end":128,"type":152,"data":260},141,{"link_type":33,"url":261,"target":262},"best-courier-services-in-the-uk.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fsignature","_blank",{"start":259,"end":128,"type":163},{"dimensions":265,"alt":266,"copyright":36,"url":267,"id":268,"edit":269},{"width":166,"height":166},"Success icon","best-courier-services-in-the-uk.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8d947c5f-d007-4da4-b0c6-86691eda4240_success.svg","Yh96GBIAACwA-Zsm",{"x":47,"y":47,"zoom":48,"background":49},{},{"theme":28,"title":272,"description":273,"showPaddingTop":20},"What makes Evri the best UK courier services for small and medium parcels?","Our size and weight limits aren’t a restriction of our service; they’re a commitment to the cheap, fast and safe delivery of small and medium parcels across the country and internationally. We offer complete flexibility, an outstanding service you can rely on, and for great value. Each time you send parcels with us, you and your customers can enjoy these benefits plus the following:","list_block$f8a7916b-021d-4b77-bf39-d14925e5751c","list_block",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":277,"primary":278,"id":299,"slice_type":81,"slice_label":36},[],{"CardImage":279,"CardAvatar":65,"CardTitle":287,"CardText":288,"ButtonText":295,"ButtonUrl":296,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":280,"alt":283,"copyright":36,"url":284,"id":285,"edit":286},{"width":281,"height":282},7723,5151,"Customer walking towards a ParcelShop store holding a parcel. The blue Evri signage can be seen on the storefront with a free-standing sign near the entrance.","best-courier-services-in-the-uk.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJL5bqstJ9-Tf1_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2863.jpg?auto=format,compress","Z6TJL5bqstJ9-Tf1",{"x":47,"y":47,"zoom":48,"background":49},"Save up to 26% with our new small parcel service",[289],{"type":69,"text":290,"spans":291,"direction":72},"If you need to send a smaller parcel, you could save up to 26% or £1.27 for every small parcel you send.  Our NEW small parcel service is available for parcels up to 2kg and measuring up to 45cm x 35cm x 16cm. You will still get benefits such as up to £20 cover end-to-end tracking and more included. ",[292],{"start":293,"end":294,"type":163},110,113,"Send a small parcel",{"link_type":33,"key":297,"url":298},"124ef0af-3f55-4a08-bc19-1ad28cbeceb4","best-courier-services-in-the-uk.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fsmall-parcel","card$fd96195a-9c4a-48a8-880e-ec3f0882b868",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":301,"primary":303,"id":312,"slice_type":313,"slice_label":36},[302],{},{"heading":304,"description":305,"image":306},"The best courier service is a trusted one","More than 99% of our parcels are delivered on time, and it hasn’t gone unnoticed. We're ending 2025 with over 4 million 5-star reviews on Trustpilot and a GREAT score of 4.1 out of 5. \n\nWhen it comes to satisfaction, there should be no expense spared. With Evri’s low-cost shipping, you can cut your delivery expenses and receive amazing feedback. As well as delivering for some of the UK’s largest retailers, our services can be made flexible at all stages of delivery, from drop off to delivery. \n\nTrust Evri to deliver your parcel, whether it’s to a friend, loved one or valued customer, check out what they could be saying:",{"dimensions":307,"alt":308,"copyright":36,"url":309,"id":310,"edit":311},{"width":59,"height":60},"A family of four pose smiling in front of their front door holding two parcels. The family consists of a father, mother and two daughters.","best-courier-services-in-the-uk.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tjlJbqstJ9-fAS_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7201.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6tjlJbqstJ9-fAS",{"x":47,"y":47,"zoom":48,"background":49},"trust_pilot$5122d38d-4b9f-4d28-948d-e02b48f75590","trust_pilot",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":315,"primary":317,"id":364,"slice_type":81,"slice_label":36},[316],{},{"CardImage":318,"CardAvatar":65,"CardTitle":328,"CardText":329,"ButtonText":360,"ButtonUrl":361,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":319,"alt":321,"copyright":36,"url":322,"id":323,"edit":324},{"width":59,"height":320},672,"Woman handing parcel to cashier at Post Office","best-courier-services-in-the-uk.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fad941cc1-66cb-47db-912a-0d4b785cd153_DSCF4172.jpg?auto=compress,format&rect=0,269,6924,4653&w=1000&h=672","ZTvF5BUAACkAYc82",{"x":47,"y":325,"zoom":326,"background":327},-38,0.14442518775274407,"#fff","Our incredible ParcelShops",[330,339,342,346,349,352],{"type":69,"text":331,"spans":332,"direction":72},"We’re constantly engaging with local communities to enhance access to our facilities for sending and receiving parcels. That’s why we’ve opened 9,000+ ParcelShops into local businesses across the UK, including selected Post Offices. ",[333,338],{"start":334,"end":335,"type":152,"data":336},219,231,{"link_type":33,"url":337,"target":209},"best-courier-services-in-the-uk.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fpost-office-services",{"start":334,"end":335,"type":163},{"type":69,"text":340,"spans":341,"direction":72},"With 94% of the UK population living within 2 miles of a ParcelShop or Locker, we’ve made sure our locations are convenient to suit any schedule, with most including:",[],{"type":343,"text":344,"spans":345,"direction":72},"list-item","Longer opening hours",[],{"type":343,"text":347,"spans":348,"direction":72},"Open 7 days a week",[],{"type":343,"text":350,"spans":351,"direction":72},"FREE parking nearby",[],{"type":69,"text":353,"spans":354,"direction":72},"You can simply select the Evri ParcelShop option when you make a booking or divert your parcel and find the ParcelShop that's most convenient. Once delivered, your customer can collect their parcel at any time within opening hours.",[355,359],{"start":356,"end":255,"type":152,"data":357},76,{"link_type":33,"url":358,"target":209},"best-courier-services-in-the-uk.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fguides\u002Fdivert-your-parcel",{"start":356,"end":255,"type":163},"Find out more",{"link_type":33,"key":362,"url":363},"2effc470-6fb2-427c-aed0-73cfd2f1eaa8","best-courier-services-in-the-uk.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops","card$a7177c81-a29e-4997-8aaa-f386cd08bc6d",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":366,"primary":368,"id":399,"slice_type":81,"slice_label":36},[367],{},{"CardImage":369,"CardAvatar":65,"CardTitle":376,"CardText":377,"ButtonText":387,"ButtonUrl":388,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":370,"alt":371,"copyright":36,"url":372,"id":373,"edit":374},{"width":59,"height":60},"ParcelShop store assistant is placing the customer's packageless items into a FSC-approved bag, ready to return to the retailer.","best-courier-services-in-the-uk.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TIz5bqstJ9-TfE_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2344.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=47%2C0%2C5906%2C3939&w=1000&h=667","Z6TIz5bqstJ9-TfE",{"x":375,"y":47,"zoom":48,"background":49},47,"Simple parcel returns with Evri",[378,381,384],{"type":69,"text":379,"spans":380,"direction":72},"Return items quickly and simply with Evri:",[],{"type":343,"text":382,"spans":383,"direction":72},"Book a return online through our website or app and print the label at home or using our Print In ParcelShop devices. Drop off the parcel at your nearest ParcelShop and hand it straight to the shop assistant or place it inside one of our secure Lockers.",[],{"type":343,"text":385,"spans":386,"direction":72},"If you have a business or corporate account with us, you can open a returns account. This means returns can be made free for customers and they can simply head to their local ParcelShop with a Print In ParcelShop device to carry out the whole process in-store.",[],"Return a parcel",{"id":389,"type":390,"tags":391,"lang":15,"slug":393,"first_publication_date":394,"last_publication_date":395,"uid":396,"url":397,"link_type":18,"key":398,"isBroken":20},"YiEyGxIAAC0AAW5a","landing-page",[392],"Return a Parcel","easy-ways-to-return-a-parcel-with-evri","2022-03-03T21:24:50+0000","2026-03-09T21:54:29+0000","return-a-parcel","\u002Freturn-a-parcel","4c67e2d1-1a5e-40bc-b3e9-3f4a808acf95","card$502d99eb-c547-499b-b035-5ea52c2b76c6",{"variation":401,"version":25,"items":402,"primary":465,"id":476,"slice_type":477,"slice_label":36},"3Column",[403,425,445],{"Title":404,"Description":409,"Image":413,"Label":36,"UrlText":420,"Url":421,"buttonDataGtmTrack":36,"SecondaryButtonText":36,"SecondaryButtonUrl":424,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":36,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[405],{"type":406,"text":407,"spans":408,"direction":72},"heading3","ParcelShop ",[],[410],{"type":69,"text":411,"spans":412,"direction":72},"Collect or drop off your package at one of our 9,000+ ParcelShops. Don’t have a way to print at home? Get your postage label using our Print in ParcelShop device for free. We’ll take care of everything from there.",[],{"dimensions":414,"alt":415,"copyright":36,"url":416,"id":417,"edit":418},{"width":59,"height":60},"An Evri ParcelShop is in full view with its blue signage and a customer is walking up the accesssbility ramp and holding a parcel.","best-courier-services-in-the-uk.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf__EVRI_LOCATION_03_3111.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=470%2C0%2C5460%2C3642&w=1000&h=667","Z6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf_",{"x":419,"y":47,"zoom":48,"background":49},470,"Find your local ParcelShop",{"link_type":33,"key":422,"url":423},"e8804c35-1bed-44d9-9999-7587b7751754","best-courier-services-in-the-uk.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffind-a-parcelshop",{"link_type":38},{"Title":426,"Description":430,"Image":434,"Label":36,"UrlText":441,"Url":442,"buttonDataGtmTrack":36,"SecondaryButtonText":36,"SecondaryButtonUrl":444,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":36,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[427],{"type":406,"text":428,"spans":429,"direction":72},"Locker",[],[431],{"type":69,"text":432,"spans":433,"direction":72},"We have 24\u002F7 Lockers available in convenient locations across the UK for a quick collection or delivery. Head to your nearest Locker, scan your barcode and place into a secure Locker, ready for collection.",[],{"dimensions":435,"alt":436,"copyright":36,"url":437,"id":438,"edit":439},{"width":59,"height":60},"Customer holding parcel and standing outside at an Evri Locker, watching as their label prints out","best-courier-services-in-the-uk.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C9%2C8164%2C5445&w=1000&h=667","Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb",{"x":47,"y":440,"zoom":48,"background":49},9,"Find your nearest Locker",{"link_type":33,"key":443,"url":423},"52cff517-f68a-40fd-b43f-78aaa9d671de",{"link_type":38},{"Title":446,"Description":450,"Image":454,"Label":36,"UrlText":460,"Url":461,"buttonDataGtmTrack":36,"SecondaryButtonText":36,"SecondaryButtonUrl":464,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":36,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[447],{"type":406,"text":448,"spans":449},"Courier collection",[],[451],{"type":69,"text":452,"spans":453,"direction":72},"Door to door courier service has never been easier. Simply follow the link below to send a parcel and select Courier Collection at checkout. We’ll give you a one-hour window to pick up the parcel from your home or office.",[],{"dimensions":455,"alt":456,"copyright":36,"url":457,"id":458,"edit":459},{"width":59,"height":60},"An Evri Courier smiling towards a customer after having completed a doorstep collection. The courier is holding multiple parcels, whilst the customer is holding a blue slip containing the details of the delivery.","best-courier-services-in-the-uk.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDoZbqstJ9-cff_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4287.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6pDoZbqstJ9-cff",{"x":47,"y":47,"zoom":48,"background":49},"More information",{"link_type":33,"key":462,"url":463},"face6675-1516-4b40-97fb-5c92c1f733b0","best-courier-services-in-the-uk.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"link_type":38},{"SectionTitle":466,"SectionDescription":471,"theme":475},[467],{"type":468,"text":469,"spans":470,"direction":72},"heading2","3 easy ways to send, collect and return a parcel",[],[472],{"type":69,"text":473,"spans":474},"",[],"neutral","article_link_module$9c52fcec-289a-467e-90b4-211b5aff45ea","article_link_module",{"variation":479,"version":25,"items":480,"primary":529,"id":533,"slice_type":534,"slice_label":36},"default",[481,497,513],{"title":482,"content":483,"icon":487,"link":493,"linkLabel":360,"backgroundColor":496},"Evri Standard Account",[484],{"type":69,"text":485,"spans":486,"direction":72},"Enjoy all the features of an Evri account, plus get access to great savings when you spend £30+, collect Tesco Clubcard points, and subscribe to our marketing for exclusive offers.",[],{"dimensions":488,"alt":489,"copyright":36,"url":490,"id":491,"edit":492},{"width":166,"height":166},"Parcel icon","best-courier-services-in-the-uk.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F15159101-ea95-4f4d-8762-549a8e631c4f_parcel3.svg","Yh96GBIAACwA-Zsn",{"x":47,"y":47,"zoom":48,"background":49},{"link_type":33,"key":494,"url":495},"27247633-a4ae-4d81-a685-2362f01ab6fb","\u002Fstandard-account","neutral-01",{"title":498,"content":499,"icon":503,"link":509,"linkLabel":512,"backgroundColor":496},"Evri Frequent Seller Account",[500],{"type":69,"text":501,"spans":502,"direction":72},"Made for growing small businesses, this is a free, no-commitment account upgrade that gives you up to 50% off UK deliveries and 20% off international deliveries when you send 40+ parcels per month.",[],{"dimensions":504,"alt":505,"copyright":36,"url":506,"id":507,"edit":508},{"width":166,"height":166},"Large parcel icon","best-courier-services-in-the-uk.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F97975357-8cb0-4e5c-8466-86156e50fd76_parcel2.svg","Yh96FRIAAC8A-Zrt",{"x":47,"y":47,"zoom":48,"background":49},{"link_type":33,"key":510,"url":511},"549b77cf-c7d1-4f78-9f08-2e2e207d4e05","\u002Ffrequent-seller","Learn more",{"title":514,"content":515,"icon":519,"link":525,"linkLabel":528,"backgroundColor":496},"Evri Business Account",[516],{"type":69,"text":517,"spans":518,"direction":72},"Growing fast and regularly sending 150+ parcels per week? Get regular van collections, discounted pricing, and enhanced customer service with a dedicated Evri Business Account.",[],{"dimensions":520,"alt":521,"copyright":36,"url":522,"id":523,"edit":524},{"width":166,"height":166},"Icon of a lorry turning left","best-courier-services-in-the-uk.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F368d77c0-145d-4481-a619-4399e853d1cb_lorry+-+facing+left.svg","Yh96FhIAAC8A-Zr6",{"x":47,"y":47,"zoom":48,"background":49},{"link_type":33,"key":526,"url":527},"537f0571-eef4-4782-85b1-fc6391a414f2","\u002Fbusiness\u002Fenquiry-form\u002Fbusiness-details","Enquire today",{"sectionTitle":530,"sectionDescription":531,"linksStyle":532},"An account to suit you","Looking for an affordable, reliable way to send parcels across the UK and internationally? We have everything you need.","primary","feature_l